	"visibility"		"2"
	"title"		"FireWatch - Campfire Monitor"
	"description"		"Keep your campfires burning!\n\nFireWatch adds a small panel to the HUD that lists every burning campfire with a colour-coded burn bar (green > yellow > red), sorted so the one closest to going out is on top. The panel hides itself when no campfire is burning and on the naval map.\n\nClick a row to glide the camera to that fire. With the mod option 'Move cursor to clicked fire' (Settings > Mods, default On) the cursor also lands on the fire, so you can press R to add wood right away.\n\nCreated using the Whiskerwood modkit https://github.com/Whiskerwood-Modding/Whiskerwood-Project"
	"changenote"		"First release"
}
